    "detailed_description": "Cattlieb is a pinball-style roguelike battle game where you launch orbs into a board filled with interactive objects that affect the outcome of each fight.<br />\r\nEach shot you take determines not just the damage you deal, but also which bonuses or penalties you activate. Some objects grant buffs or restore health, while others trigger traps, debuffs, or unexpected effects. Learning how to aim and adapting to the board layout is key to surviving.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBetween battles, you\u2019ll encounter branching paths, events, and upgrades that change your build. Collect relics that alter gameplay rules, experiment with different orb combinations, and find synergies that suit your playstyle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features a fantasy world with a whimsical surface and a serious undertone. Supervised by illustrator Karei, the visuals offer a unique charm that sets the tone for your mysterious adventure. Cattlieb is designed for players of all ages, and its ongoing development is shaped by community feedback.",
